---
description: Recover the target competency and required decision separately from incidental story elements.
args: { dossier: LearningDossier; change: AdaptationChange }
returns: CompetencyKernel[]
---
For each training mechanism, preserve competency ID, required decision, decision steps and tradeoffs. Mark analogies, names, setting and props as incidental only when the source supports that distinction. Bind every element to curriculum version and evidence. Do not redefine the learning objective to fit a convenient scenario.
